  "goodToKnow": "Die Instandhaltung is maintenance or upkeep: die Instandhaltung von Gebäuden, Brücken, Maschinen. Germany has a large Instandhaltungsstau (maintenance backlog) in its infrastructure, from crumbling motorway bridges (the Carolabrücke in Dresden partly collapsed in 2024) to schools and railways. Die Instandsetzung is repair. Synonym: die Wartung. Plural: die Instandhaltungen."
